  "goodToKnow": "Die Normalität is normality: zur Normalität zurückkehren, die neue Normalität (the new normal, a phrase heard a lot during the Covid pandemic). Gefühlte Normalität means a sense of normality. Normal means normal, and colloquially of course: Normal! The word Normalo is slang for an ordinary person. Die Norm is a norm or standard, and DIN norms (Deutsches Institut für Normung) gave the world A4 paper. It has no plural."
